              <div id="fc-front-options" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 max-w-2xl mx-auto"><div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slatebg-900/80 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 truncate">A) Medeni Hukuk</div><div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slatebg-900/80 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 truncate">B) Borçlar Hukuku</div><div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slatebg-900/80 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 truncate">C) Ticaret Hukuku</div><div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slatebg-900/80 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 truncate">D) Vergi Hukuku</div><div class="text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slatebg-900/80 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 truncate">E) Devletler Özel Hukuku</div></div>
